# API (entry)

Concern rules layer on via tighter globs (`api-http`, `api-prisma`, `api-auth`). Map: [`.cursor/rules/README.md`](README.md).

- Nest + PostgreSQL + Prisma 6. Staff identity is `Admin` (not guest `User`).
- Root `.env` only (`DATABASE_URL`, `SESSION_SECRET`).
- Overlap checks in DB/transactions. Reservation sources: `manual` | `website` | `booking_com` | `airbnb` | `agoda`.
- iCal updates PMS only — does not refresh OTAs.
- Read `apps/api/AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/monorepo-tooling.mdc`.
